WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.773
Sometimes a lead asks something the AI has not been told. It does not guess. It asks you, once, and then it remembers the answer for every lead after.

00:00:09.923 --> 00:00:21.829
Here, a lead has asked whether they need a big following. The AI has no answer, so it has sent nothing. A red box shows the question, and the conversation is tagged Needs human.

00:00:21.979 --> 00:00:30.322
Just reply to the lead as you normally would. With the box ticked, your reply is saved as the answer. That is all you need to do.

00:00:30.472 --> 00:00:36.917
You can also answer from Playbook. The red badge in the menu shows how many questions are waiting for you.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:48.226
Each question is listed once, with every lead who asked it. Here, two leads asked the same thing in different words. Type your answer and press Save answer and teach the AI.

00:00:48.376 --> 00:00:56.634
The answer moves into What the AI has been taught. You can edit it, switch it off, or add answers of your own here at any time.

00:00:56.784 --> 00:01:06.471
And every lead who was waiting gets a reply, written from your answer. On Autopilot it is sent for you. Otherwise it is drafted, ready to send.

00:01:06.621 --> 00:01:12.981
The more you answer, the less it asks. After the first few weeks, most questions are handled without you.
